methods  Thirty\u2010four patients with moderate to severe AA (eight men, mean age 40\u00b1\u200913 years) were enrolled
in a randomized, double\u2010blind, right\u2010to\u2010left, placebo\u2010controlled, 24\u2010week trial. Alopecia      
grading score (AGS) was calculated at baseline and after 12 and 24 weeks of treatment using a 0\u20135 score            
