study_abstract = "OBJECTIVE To investigate the efficacy of aromatherapy in the treatment of patients with alopecia      
areata. DESIGN A randomized, double-blind, controlled trial of 7 months' duration, with follow-up at 3 and 7 months.    
SETTING Dermatology outpatient department. PARTICIPANTS Eighty-six patients diagnosed as having alopecia areata.        
